    {
      "block_id": "2605.23244_p5_b18",
      "text": "Equation (4). Two subproblems must first be solved effi-\nciently, then the algorithm only requires vector addition\nand one matrix-vector product. The structure of these sub-\nproblems makes CRONOS readily compatible with local\nhardware accelerators and JAX.\n",
