      "char_count": 33,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.23244_p5_b21",
      "text": "Since COALA interprets the preference alignment task as\na convex optimization problem application, it also immedi-\nately inherits the rich convergence theory associated with\nconvex algorithms. In particular, we show that this leads\n",
